    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 80 Adelaide Square is a beautifully appointed two bedroom, two bathroom apartment presented in turnkey condition boasting one designated car space in the underground car park. \n\nPerched on the upper floor, this bright and spacious property is well proportioned, measuring 78 Sq.m / 840 Sq. Ft. The accommodation is bright, modern and spacious and comprises a large open plan living/ kitchen, 2 double bedrooms (master en-suite) with ample storage space and a modern bathroom.\n\nAdelaide is ideally located just a short walk from the heart of Dublin City. Behind its secure, gated entrance lies a private enclave designed for comfort and convenience. Residents enjoy access to an impressive suite of amenities, including 24-hour concierge and security service and private underground parking, all maintained to a high standard.\n\nWhether you're a professional seeking proximity to the city centre or a discerning buyer looking for a stylish City Centre base, this apartment delivers on every level. With excellent public transport links and all the cultural, culinary, and commercial attractions of Dublin just minutes away, this is city living at its finest. Dublin Castle, Christchurch and Temple Bar are all within a few minutes stroll, as is Grafton Street, Trinity College and The Royal College of Surgeons."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 3.26m x 2.73m\n\n\nKitchen/ Dining - 4.73m x 3.88m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.21m x 3.15m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.94m x 1.88m\n\n\nBedroom - 4.21m x 2.65m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.25m x 1.65m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two bedroom, two bathroom spacious apartment</li><li> Excellent condition throughout</li><li> Measuring c. 78 sqm/840sqft</li><li> 24 hour concierge</li><li> Gated and well maintained development</li><li> Lift access</li><li> Secure underground designated car space and storage unit</li><li> Grafton Street, Stephens Green, RCSI and Trinity are all within 10 minutes walking distance</li><li> A variety of cafes, restaurants, gyms and bars on your doorstep</ul>"
      },
      {
